# Repository layout

| Kind | Location |
|------|----------|
| Production applications | `src/<App>/` |
| Tests | `tests/<App>.Tests/` |
| Standalone tools / benches | `tools/` (not in `NMS.slnx`) |
| Deployment scripts | `deploy/<area>/` |
| Local evidence, CodeQL DBs, disposable reports | `.artifacts/` (gitignored) |
| On-demand Native AOT release packages | `release/` (gitignored) |
| Permanent docs (explicitly accepted) | `docs/` |

## Boundaries

- Applications must not depend on unrelated applications without an explicit shared ownership model.
- Tools must not become production dependencies of applications.
- Tests stay out of production projects.
- Do not write generated logs, SARIF, publish trees, or operator output into `src/`, `tests/`, `tools/`, or `.github/`.
- CodeQL evidence defaults to `.artifacts/codeql/`.

Promotion of material from `.artifacts/` into `docs/` or `src/` requires an explicit user decision.
